      "id": "claim_37661ee2d11a4c98a3eed34bdc9024ba",
      "statement": "Sandbox acquisition is thread-bound: it reuses a cached backend or reconnects through persisted sandbox metadata, and normal agent threads do not silently replace an unreachable sandbox because doing so could discard uncommitted work; deleted sandboxes may be replaced and reviewers may opt in to unreachable replacement.",
