    {
      "id": "claim_a85f5e993f3343298671c4aa9fc9ff3e",
      "statement": "When a dashboard user sends a follow-up to a busy thread, the message is queued for injection into the active run at its next model call; the system authorizes the sender and returns 409 if a machine principal attempts interaction. If the thread is idle, a new run is created instead.",
