    {
      "id": "claim_4676c9eb0cec428fa028838d15464dc4",
      "statement": "Queued messages are rebuilt through conversion: ordinary blocks become human messages attributed to their supplied sender on the web surface, dynamic context is emitted only when its hash is not already visible to the model respecting summarization cutoffs, and each structured envelope is its own message.",
