      "id": "claim_3b46c48deadf4ecd8d7b18c30f54cb64",
      "statement": "The queue middleware resolves the thread model for image-url payloads, omits unsupported fetched images with a vision warning, and isolates errors so a model call continues; a failed queue read still flushes previously assembled content blocks.",
